################################################################################
# BF_MMIO SERVER ENGINE: PRODUCTION DATABASE HTTP/1:1 PROTOCOL STACK          #
# Language: Pure Brainfuck: 8 Instructions                                    #
# Architecture: BF_MMIO: Memory Mapped IO on 256 Cell Hardware Tape           #
################################################################################

# TAPE REGISTER MEMORY MAP:
#   Cells 0 to 7   : System Call and Control Registers: Method PathLen Slot Auth
#   Cells 8 to 15  : Hardware JWT HMAC SHA256 Coprocessor Strobe: MMIO_CRYPTO
#   Cells 16 to 31 : SQLite B Tree Leaf Reader and WAL Append Strobe: MMIO_DB
#   Cells 32 to 47 : io_uring Direct Descriptor Network Strobe: MMIO_NET
#   Cells 48 to 63 : Arithmetic Accumulators Mismatch Scores and Loop Flags
#   Cells 64 to 255: Request URI Path Buffer and Integer Digit Accumulators


